# Trim kernel drivers for hardware this product never has: no CAN bus
# (no can-utils/wiring), no camera (no camera dtoverlay, no V4L2 tooling),
# no NFC/raw-flash/IR-remote, and DRM/framebuffer/touchscreen controller
# drivers for panels and touch chips other than the three DSI panels and
# two touch chips (Goodix GT911, EDT-FT5x06) this product actually ships.
# Applied to both boards from this one file; see the history of
# board/raspberrypi4-64/linux.config for the per-block audit this was
# derived from.
# CONFIG_CAN is not set
# CONFIG_CAN_J1939 is not set
